{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:1084205972d45b20f6e80f37579fe732b64279d30fb1fd469e966addbfad77eb",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6130f9ebf1b02313a1bc41b324c3089f75784a6c7cf00c0fa0f9495471d6502a",
      "text": "上啊，试镜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7c509f8474d2a162835846b3ed027e3b3e5865d639ef2e945466d51fc462cbf",
      "text": "为了参加试镜，朱雀和玄武\n需要填写履历书。\n朱雀觉得应该写上成为不良少年的契机，\n于是向玄武讲述了小时候的一段相遇。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:851f32e78985f5b441d8d086b8782f09b00f4cc9633468b884231e293ac344f8",
      "text": "第4话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6130f9ebf1b02313a1bc41b324c3089f75784a6c7cf00c0fa0f9495471d6502a",
      "text": "上啊，试镜！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0795d581762892a72b0d4d6babaaaa3cd0bc8f7271c0bad7cf0736cded5cc655",
      "text": "参加偶像的试镜，\n还得写履历书啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:15ac1873297152ba02b643a758450ee135f1460e82f661b7057a7510ec496646",
      "text": "嗯，是那位制作人的要求。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9c4f3e006768d7341b5d9e73578a1cde30793e24ca03093437fdfd03bd80b037",
      "text": "既然是经历，那就是那个吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1775283cd2414ee2524c54df29a147d3f96cb699ee7360e48947b4a551df0d03",
      "text": "把我们什么时候开始当不良少年的，\n写上去比较好吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b17ee4f78a2a4fdb5bf5c8b05cd961ab309c9358bcd64e0d8b8a9738ca861979",
      "text": "喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ef6b5a6e2c66c86407e2736fabf098bdd112488cd35f83a1b126650ef04d904",
      "text": "是啊。……说起来，我还没听朱雀说过\n你当不良少年的契机呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:659047f567d999a93cdec910f0f7a0ebfbb2112ed404f96cad71b65169b47829",
      "text": "哎，是这样吗？\n我契机是因为遇到了茨城的鬼神啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ac8c507616b28603913c28260b8301a4cfd52121aa99d5fe6a5d6650ef6e3c4",
      "text": "那还是上小学之前的事了吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5557698311c636c10f2b9a42b4d2104d97195f6ede2d7f8fe568eb4cb15bed33",
      "text": "……毕竟是小时候的事了，\n可能有些地方也记不太清了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b6b1b620b416643de237d3ea10ea940c63e84dbe1c74077e6a6ce4e8637460b",
      "text": "跟父母去巡回演出的时候，\n大吵了一架，然后跑出去了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ffccabd97e10b9b1450acd631abb26800094f1900dab4090366d4d0b0d29069",
      "text": "周围全黑下来了之后，\n想回也回不去……只能蜷缩在树旁边。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edc3ef5feea907c619e063ee5ed77a8bda8f19b33234335a9a9445c1a591213f",
      "text": "呜呜……好黑。好冷哦……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_b:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:169af84192b5afeda9b25904d30dd8e07395b5baa57bca3429b65b4a1cb06909",
      "text": "什么！好刺眼……\n哇啊……好大的摩托车……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:30b3d463145ec947fc9b207050677ea85e1616a865702d30e0ad93165fb22faa",
      "text": "喂。你这家伙，迷路了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9648415d6420aa9cd2a1fbc5697ee5d9cf4012b49196896c7a2afd0510206fc6",
      "text": "才、才没有迷路！\n是跟爸妈吵架跑出来的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edcd191fe06290380389aa9e22b4f2f88b2a6e22b501b2e2322a4f63f3b5fc85",
      "text": "嗯——虽然不知道你打算在这呆到什么时候，\n但穿成这样很冷吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:514915b619889617c952231949eed412a8a86965615c606c13bcbef3625375d8",
      "text": "……拿去，穿上这个。\n多少能暖和一点。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b72e5613148ee07c629ce084ec96aa097cc23dd91df0d869c56fb4f9508526f0",
      "text": "诶？可是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b746e99676e8e5303bee82578e85f992a179ba888b8d48bc9110ebb4e14d9b8",
      "text": "吵架归吵架，别让父母太担心啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5434d4cfb0486072c878a1d3ef70c103b47c8b6d3847335e9d2d25cdafa7396",
      "text": "既然没迷路，自己家在哪总知道吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a",
      "text": "嗯……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c63cf6ed7e96d2f830ad0f2ae6ac89b3c8f03ff3a7aa058dff90ad9f198b9ab",
      "text": "那就好。趁着还没感冒赶紧回去，\n好好跟他们和好吧。回见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_b:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:784fd626f72f6c1f507440792137c585a559d920e489f2d4b47db5de8d08981b",
      "text": "（太帅了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c70a13a156437604ac0b8eee5eb60eeefdb9f9f437f34768772989dbc11bef51",
      "text": "把自己最体面的衣服给素不相识的小鬼后就扬长而去的\n那份温柔与男子气概，让我彻底迷上了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e440a0d153812e2e35564acee3b391574cd5c826196a0678f098515e3689ea0a",
      "text": "……所以你才把茨城鬼神的特攻服给供起来了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eaa7e685e55e9741d0205b627051de9ff61b848adb89bd57165259b0ae2f4074",
      "text": "是啊，我为了模仿那个人，\n才开始穿不良少年的衣服的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfacf5e84c16a371ed9e25ac3b8234ed1f586f602bdf7f061953e56629bccc6a",
      "text": "不过，让我觉得自己接近了理想中的不良少年，\n还是在遇到玄武之后啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df424a7dbd70fa9318ca20f0bd8bbebe55568a9ca926e37504ef18cba4d7d78a",
      "text": "毕竟用狠眼神把恶人全部退治的风格\n总算是成型了嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3bd8575caa697f78eeac71b92a612ae1f378ee66139d916f8dbfdc7a705299b",
      "text": "……是这样吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3012ea0d3cf9f101db1dd939f4fba6f0a22b429b9743208d337e0c245046dcbd",
      "text": "言归正传，能让你行动到那种地步，\n茨城的鬼神也是个相当炽热的汉子啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ae3372f203b1ccf285ec00d06bd16de5c0e429f5fe53938c43860efe172db27",
      "text": "是啊！\n说起来，玄武是什么时候开始当不良少年的？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bfcbe409e359fdbe5c4b305e90ba56bbc86a4df5c9490f9edb5116ab88e8f09",
      "text": "遇到的时候就已经是现在的感觉了。\n有什么契机吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f9162e8b7b9110542da70b54200a6cfc097a527f05a752278a276d2515e3b53",
      "text": "这个嘛……\n初一的时候，就已经是这样了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36751ca71c91055de612b6bfbd61ee9ffcea302685c08cf569e7a07ed76a0684",
      "text": "我以前在福利院待过，跟你说过吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcf0e6ed64fa56520cb4f2587a9939d856a84521ee8c3c42ff62b2208ef93b2b",
      "text": "有些人会以此为由找茬，\n或者摆出一副轻蔑的态度。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:649b3a6300251ad93d161c54af9566c46ef0f4f042197ee052d545dc442d3fd3",
      "text": "你说什么！？\n就因为这种理由找茬，绝对不能原谅！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_c:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:263821c516d81380b40aaa27bf7465d2472e61f58d93ff49392b373f6a0a0b1a",
      "text": "冷静点，朱雀。都是过去的事了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f05bad506c2b8c233ff2aa19b2951ef8441d045f32f0be7da4d23d56e0af3a9",
      "text": "为了从那些家伙手里保护自己和福利院的小鬼们，\n不知不觉就变成这样了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86868b89db3f23a3b1ec62d0569888100953ad84a53994edaad939f5972fdd1c",
      "text": "（那时的想法，并没有错）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_d:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e87bb5048262691c718c84a47f2ffd00d1dea1bcc56c491d880e39c3f7a1e25",
      "text": "（看到我不良少年的打扮，\n跑来找茬的家伙确实变少了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8d4f777e436a3b15da3c58fcbb5542244f3f3db384082835bb016e098e2256b",
      "text": "（虽然正因这身打扮，也有无可救药的家伙\n甚至借用父母的权力来贬低我就是了……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10ac38eb1df303ca1dd66f4c361b4ff4797a358fd79a1e73ded3fbdfd0aead6a",
      "text": "（但我成功守护到底了）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5d27de5861aed6cf8ba1a546ed5e2b6fb3551d150fe80cfedd5274d548220c9",
      "text": "听了刚才的话，我总算明白\n为什么和玄武这么合得来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:36b356e6c6db9dce93fd9801832042fc3db0b12c69217baae0fdecda35196895",
      "text": "因为都是为了从恶徒手里保护别人，\n才变成不良少年的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ed8b3aab29b86cd88efe99095543fde0ca19ba72c2e953af6b59494b3d9e272",
      "text": "能遇到你这样的家伙，\n还能成为相棒，我可太走运了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_d:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b8a16e8228921e8d5172966ced9679b2a651442875e6c67d5d6a9458598f8a20",
      "text": "我也是啊，相棒。\n能遇到你真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_e:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d1f302202c9c282c78223381cca1bb1397113ce1b3627ad38fcda5b33bac319",
      "text": "履历书差不多该送到制作人那里了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:991677a69d562fcfed0dae34d717b506a63904b5618a52a3d14022828a4cffc2",
      "text": "一日千秋。虽然明白筛选需要时间，\n但还是等联络等得心急啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_e:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6323d6227a3a2eef12d67d06e907acb26184e5dc6171a2bc7b164c8d02f4c580",
      "text": "噢，说曹操曹操到，\n是●●●●プロデューサー打来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b126ae445eaf90914dc34d99f0b68f965e0063bc454b4ee9da9b34425be7dd5e",
      "text": "朱雀先生，辛苦了。\n现在方便说话吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dbe74f038c0e468c49b34f398f092fc0cae79996294be3a962734c455716aed9",
      "text": "啊，方便啊。稍等一下。\n玄武也在。我开个免提。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92be7eeb0bfc731ab0bdf14e825c1ea32a94c8bbc089de500f43fa01558a9563",
      "text": "联络得真快啊。\n是提交的资料有什么欠缺吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4666abcbe7b465eab8ae12d9b65d783474737294431a0fb045784a794f94b2ff",
      "text": "没有！是联合试镜的日程\n定下来了，特地来联络二位。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:178adc3234905b371610b630ca4a11672a576d989ad5411d676d8df790a91704",
      "text": "已经定下来了吗！\n太好啦，玄武！要试镜了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_e:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6abe7a502b3bc6e42e137b77261d3e1f43f3ef273c41df3ba1f64db19d5d1f42",
      "text": "试镜上经常会被问到特长。\n如果有可以展示的东西，请提前练习一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_e:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "噢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_e:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:678978ebed10b3c939593bbb645c803a3a630efabf02a4795cf57e7ce1ea7967",
      "text": "详细信息会通过邮件发送。\n那么当天就拜托各位了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7360d36e34b3334413d47865b6daaaa6bf8aad8a988ec393d94aff9e525d04c",
      "text": "说到我们的特长，那就是那个了吧。\n虽说根本用不着练习……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb6207d87491cc9ca3dae17591ad55426774fd78bc7ea5e3acb48688d3c4a03",
      "text": "天空朱雀落！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11fe667fc62f5a21501ce8a9f48e0fdbce5c73098d3e033ac35b2abf3aabdb56",
      "text": "天玄冰刃波！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:11594551f448f067ed0bedeccb65b539d2e21ad4b55997ffda262de85058271a",
      "text": "哇喔！？怎么了，\n出什么事了吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de5bb0bf589521dfe32f379117e47bec01fdf1e16d3c131eeace4970fe588c35",
      "text": "噢，你们在啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76595177befc6714c0c49cf751d454189610ed88f683d2eec9cf8fc7117fa722",
      "text": "要去和哪个高中的干架吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000096:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afb2106ddd7aa072a83fce52a14d57135a7ce77fdf9ec5703d91e16735b90bf1",
      "text": "不。……也没什么好瞒的。我们要去参加\n偶像的试镜。在为此做练习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be8a395d0180507b13f2b14108a7d328c352084d0a4b02c08ae69f36330c0a33",
      "text": "试镜！？最近一直在打听偶像的事，\n原来是为了这个啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61201809267611a405db52a1fb125b411e887e2faa18e8ce493a7fbe56ee48aa",
      "text": "嘿嘿，算是吧。\n详细情况回头再跟你们说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_f:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70ba1bf913ce57a6ba601cf478efbef3f6abb494d72dd1cfcf9eff90d613b8c1",
      "text": "你们知道吗？不良少年和偶像，\n可是有共同点的哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_g:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e318e020e5347328092121568e9388922ec1af9d0c3999fc27c95a73be18428",
      "text": "……原来是这样啊。两位是要成为比现在\n更伟大的存在吗……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17b252e88f116fe8d17dd4bc1c6f1b391bc4b6dbb0ccf427978dc3fb70a77bfd",
      "text": "太帅了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_g:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b33f50ed45f0c90f8d20a207535f150cbe6f18f6ac07a19bdbd0f525f3435a2",
      "text": "高兴得太早了。要想成为偶像，\n首先得通过试镜才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_g:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e433227b74dd82098338a2e328f974b39acb0d34a8f129af5aee7c1b102b19ee",
      "text": "我一直觉得，对朱雀先生和玄武先生来说，\n樱绚的池子太小了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_g:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d388de6bcc4e237a5673c8f79b605da295ba0bde7f03d8bbcf9c0c70bce0803f",
      "text": "如果有什么我们能帮得上忙的，\n请尽管吩咐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_g:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8f63ac67909c67dbba6bad30f839ef8f029a95246cc55cfb31eb8b020521881",
      "text": "噢，谢啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_g:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:760615f61e9e19c847f4e59f113ba513a155948c50c59e7549960bfa0f198ba6",
      "text": "偶像是有了粉丝才成立的，\n这是我从演唱会DVD里学到的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8655fa8c739b14558cecb8a59a5cabd710fa2926919dc6637a0f88067fb2f301",
      "text": "如果能得到你们客观的意见，\n那就帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_g:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72d733f58740a6bd71e0de0c885fc1fed0f39603bea79ab19ce94058a0439b12",
      "text": "好嘞！那么面向试镜，\n特训开始啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07040148948158ee20d24c7db4ef47855c677f0883c4b54eb1257d81ef39b206",
      "text": "试镜当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1431c9610414b33b3d05bf085aaad1237bcb9e2e2ca24ff781b29c6468f6c44f",
      "text": "嗯？怎么了？我们一走进来，\n周围就开始骚动起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3203ba35eb16f3100f337f7a8178a4d29bcb65890dc836b4172c73c68cb8c73e",
      "text": "毕竟看起来没有其他从不良少年转行做偶像的参赛者嘛。\n我们的打扮很罕见吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35aea8cf934ac01020076f790829d25f8448c75e9dd8bb63373008364aad46fc",
      "text": "嘿……话说回来，\n居然有这么多参赛者啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e328809095f32d463af532031d493e352c3110842e0cb0c42d52635e5941405",
      "text": "（嗯？朱雀这家伙……好像很紧张啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:deaed1d081cdcf9ff7d16f3a41d34ec967d81d4f0eae585d9f512352ff2ee4ad",
      "text": "嘿嘿，正合我意。\n不给他们露一手怎么行！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dda69ebfce2b4839e36d47b0ea78bec27c687ab2edbd5200f7009a17e62dc914",
      "text": "（……呵。比平时还要有干劲啊。\n刚才那是所谓的临阵兴奋发抖吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:534f8b6d55316ad2d6932b142091e73ce43b2d7e2bc8ca0d52b09c0feb38bebf",
      "text": "这次是多家事务所联合举办的试镜。\n拿出真本事让评审员眼前一亮吧，相棒！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cf528164c5d3d66895700e201178b838adf55203ed802c4aefdd724d1596c401",
      "text": "噢！大干一场吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000136:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:069375834c9df71a079431b991eadd9cef4a1f9960c8ac589adf6c228c1124ef",
      "text": "（即便在这么多人之中，\n朱雀先生和玄武先生依然格外引人注目……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000143:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:41299d5a2f2a307f8af69480addd67e687146c6c41c6733c78106bd95fd2397f",
      "text": "那么，首先请做自我介绍。\n之后请紧接着展示特长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000147:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:16003d236c5aea85d9daee6c4362fcaea1bcb704df6f7b075a338ea2089e6d9c",
      "text": "不好意思。红井先生和黑野先生，\n请两位一起进行自我介绍。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04b427dd18b29bd0735bc4621286fd4d9411b1f1ed419cef6dc0f58d22ff7f34",
      "text": "我是红井朱雀。\n然后，这是喵喜威。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000159:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea2adc4477387fa8351a5d472c0e3e247016824ff71edd7bf5a0fc6eaf87b6e4",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:65bd418e5dc129c9168d6347dc72829c18583c730add2c6fe4cab3c7f636ec2d",
      "text": "我是黑野玄武。我们是为了消灭世上的邪恶\n而以偶像为目标的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000172:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7782852859f88636ecefe11e34822094897c93f256ec2d41035ae8cd79c2de0e",
      "text": "所以，这就是我们的必杀技。\n上吧，玄武！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000177:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "噢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000201:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:735c32eb25bc3618b73db27c95d94b52fa5169f53f005095b755ea4909bb20f2",
      "text": "燃烧起来吧！\n必杀！天空朱雀落！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_h:cmd-000217:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86804f7a34a2d5cc1a835dcfed6cadbbcb38f5bb7a6c0cb48349edf623be5f13",
      "text": "刮目相看吧！\n必杀！天玄冰刃波！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_i:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "几周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_i:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdac6fe005c9c71816513d10ef0f14c80380233598e7a4d8a514973682dff134",
      "text": "315 Production的事务所……\n好像在这一边。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_i:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3ca253ed487911e2f9e7aabad2e46a5b2a52c42af5db032b13a28f6252698826",
      "text": "能顺利合格真是太好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_i:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cbf83cff9b03135263b65c2d080ff3444c5d7ab68fb194b0c1213955fda024b",
      "text": "也得去感谢一下\n陪我们练习的那帮家伙才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_i:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:922571fa94632e596d156729604219dc2907c3e8ac636a5c9b36867f69fa6b73",
      "text": "话说，朱雀。事到如今提这个，你父母\n居然会答应让你当偶像啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_i:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e136dc9c2d48a58c8e7b358e5a6d8d66022deba5d89c94847b594950c3c6c547",
      "text": "啊，当然是大吵了一架啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_i:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0340d70c6bf4e2c6c284d98352ffb5c147e9579ea24bfc0bd539e78c91c944f",
      "text": "……不过呢，今天早上突然改口说当偶像也可以。\n我问他们为什么，他们说，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_i:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:deec9ffcc760a8a09e7d569b7c924a33845422c7b621e658e7a3c5c671617d8d",
      "text": "就算当了偶像，\n他们也没放弃把我培养成职业摔角选手。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_i:cmd-000075:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a6b39f6038db7fb3df7a54f4abf094b04fbda6dcd11ade3b1567d6fee1ba5c64",
      "text": "哎，那边也有那边的考量吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29cebef5c51b23905a5c2965afe0e996f4f2307ce3d58f8e8b0e2f5759e5b956",
      "text": "总之，能得到同意就太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_j:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5175f90c6953a9111925292cd1028aa9e79b3f4de657fdd3a3bd214544751f32",
      "text": "文件的确认到这里就结束了。\n接下来我向二位说明一下今后的安排。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_j:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa48f4d48ade972944f06d0031699724b4235183db8d8000cfd84a784d32b3f4",
      "text": "今后为了让二位成功作为偶像出道，\n需要接受各种各样的课程培训。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_j:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b37e1d073a3dbcb3f09e05c1448e46ca0bcb3520ee294580571d9cb84ec523c0",
      "text": "支援工作由我来负责。如果有不明白的地方\n或者有什么想法，请随时联系我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_j:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a35979b5d9f7f28dd48292912debb69dfae22e39486f9079292dcf3fa26e2eb",
      "text": "那我就开门见山了，制作人平时\n都在做些什么样的工作，请告诉我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_j:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bfd6c85603f2ed19d073438222d36dfecdb0343e2f3fd2df44fa88a53cdc52b9",
      "text": "啊，说的也是。今后承蒙关照最多的人。\n我也想了解一下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_j:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b381e0307cec439759d65bbd5c40dc678572c9d619f7557d274d59a218bb153a",
      "text": "这个嘛……大体上来说，是负责统筹安排\n所属事务所的偶像们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eabf20889e3495ffdaa39ffc2a60c401e56de882a4e63e551fd13c0ff2495f1c",
      "text": "原来如此。量才录用。\n站在我们上方，统领并引导我们吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_j:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cdfdb156636b7701f9609d1d1a3d0fc03e8a8cbf8d461117c7c1e0fa8246b5b",
      "text": "（……既然这样）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_j:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d70ed28cba90cd187d65fac281aa2cd0752a26a0918a3e4e75918969d51b7b9",
      "text": "那我就称呼你为●●●●●●●●●●番长了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_j:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f879af2169be465a9351631c79a4e77d589d2a60bd296c9146f69584ee41c44",
      "text": "好的！朱雀先生、玄武先生、喵子，\n今后再次请多关照了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_j:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c61765f2d3ec147f6f9f6bb29e44279b5b1b084ce0b6fd4083809023bd409f06",
      "text": "我们才是，请多指教啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_009shi_04_1_1_009_04:1_1_009_04_j:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c84eca478b4c6422c532c78a2ecfa807fc88796f1462e3fd56741a1835ae5e9",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
